			rgCommunityRecommendations: [{"appid":3321460,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"222820813","appid":3321460,"accountid":95853718,"playtime_at_review":1052,"review_text":"We're going to be finding details, hidden content, and mechanics in this game for years to come. Honestly made me finally fall back in love with gaming all over again.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198056119446\/recommended\/3321460\/","votes_up":4},{"recommendationid":"222780824","appid":3321460,"accountid":52699119,"playtime_at_review":1759,"review_text":"The map is one of the best maps ever made in gaming history... this game makes me feel like a kid again, exploring the likes of Morrowind and other great exploration games!","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198012964847\/recommended\/3321460\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"222820486","appid":3321460,"accountid":53833911,"playtime_at_review":721,"review_text":"Today, I'm gonna give you the real meat and potatoes. The only thing you need to know, about Crimson Desert... ...I spent 12 hours playing it in the first day. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198014099639\/recommended\/3321460\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"222757298","appid":3321460,"accountid":116344280,"playtime_at_review":767,"review_text":"I'm hooked. Crimson World is beautiful and huge open world game that expects me to explore. So much to discover, and I love that I'm not being led by the nose - I have to actually think, figure...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198076610008\/recommended\/3321460\/","votes_up":3}]},{"appid":1963610,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"222763723","appid":1963610,"accountid":81193002,"playtime_at_review":172,"review_text":"I got the idea from the demo that this was going to be a little gritty tough scavenging game and now that EA is out that is what I'm getting. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198041458730\/recommended\/1963610\/","votes_up":5},{"recommendationid":"222815480","appid":1963610,"accountid":144047727,"playtime_at_review":161,"review_text":"Good game concept with a lot of content for the price. This review serves to support the dev.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198104313455\/recommended\/1963610\/","votes_up":4},{"recommendationid":"222797582","appid":1963610,"accountid":1543902088,"playtime_at_review":67,"review_text":"I love it! the optimization is great, the price is very good, and it even went on sale. even though it's in early access, I haven't had many problems. I really like developers like this.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199504167816\/recommended\/1963610\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"222773756","appid":1963610,"accountid":347451598,"playtime_at_review":114,"review_text":"I played this game in the early demo run when it was a Unity build all the way up to the current Godot build and have followed it the entire time. Early Access is in a good spot for a public release. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198307717326\/recommended\/1963610\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"222823040","appid":1963610,"accountid":92385854,"playtime_at_review":78,"review_text":"The music, the hardcore gameplay and hideout management are awesome! I love the ambushes and AI difficulty so far. I cant imagine how it will be with advanced AI. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198052651582\/recommended\/1963610\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"222791932","appid":1963610,"accountid":18103251,"playtime_at_review":135,"review_text":"This is exactly what I was looking for. It runs flawlessly so far. The atmosphere is 100% spot on. The shooting feels good. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197978368979\/recommended\/1963610\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"222768394","appid":1963610,"accountid":1133871064,"playtime_at_review":362,"review_text":"I played the Demo for over 90 hrs and i loved it. And the EA is even better. Does it need improvement? Yes, of course, it's an early access game. Is it fun? Hell, yeah! ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199094136792\/recommended\/1963610\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":1626170,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"222763882","appid":1626170,"accountid":89509077,"playtime_at_review":142,"review_text":"so far, the game has been generally great seeing alot of the music puns in some of the enemy names or just around the world has been great, and getting the classic JRPG style gameplay with a ff7...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198049774805\/recommended\/1626170\/","votes_up":12},{"recommendationid":"222768727","appid":1626170,"accountid":75071760,"playtime_at_review":1654,"review_text":"The story on normal is probably about 20 hours long with the rhythm timing on. it could be quicker if you don't look around the world much or do any of the side stuff. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198035337488\/recommended\/1626170\/","votes_up":9},{"recommendationid":"222758499","appid":1626170,"accountid":116501617,"playtime_at_review":263,"review_text":"Not only is the game fairly colorful, but the art style stands out to me- comic books done purely in pencil- and it suits the game perfectly! ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198076767345\/recommended\/1626170\/","votes_up":14},{"recommendationid":"222778650","appid":1626170,"accountid":6773573,"playtime_at_review":470,"review_text":"This game has been a breath of fresh air. It is just really fun, lighthearted and lovingly crafted. The game brings me back to the FFX days but with modern improvements to combat reminding me of...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197967039301\/recommended\/1626170\/","votes_up":7},{"recommendationid":"222818682","appid":1626170,"accountid":1893740848,"playtime_at_review":100,"review_text":"I\u2019ve been waiting for this game to drop since the demo! As someone who loves music, the soundtrack to this game is genuinely my favorite aspect. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199854006576\/recommended\/1626170\/","votes_up":3}]},{"appid":3552140,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"222770895","appid":3552140,"accountid":300301926,"playtime_at_review":3433,"review_text":"After playing now for over 50+ hrs I can say with all confidence that this is a great and really fun game especially if you were born in the era of going to the video stores and renting those VHS...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198260567654\/recommended\/3552140\/","votes_up":5},{"recommendationid":"222818327","appid":3552140,"accountid":334676960,"playtime_at_review":1735,"review_text":"It's a really fun game and I think it's well worth the regular price. I'm currently on level 16 at the time of this review with 28 hrs in the game and my store brings in $500+ each day if I can hand...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198294942688\/recommended\/3552140\/","votes_up":3}]},{"appid":1716740,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"222797422","appid":1716740,"accountid":70977950,"playtime_at_review":30908,"review_text":"I don't know how to review things. But I keep getting nags to write this from Steam because I keep playing it so much. Here goes nothing. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198031243678\/recommended\/1716740\/","votes_up":12},{"recommendationid":"222790888","appid":1716740,"accountid":995300537,"playtime_at_review":60544,"review_text":"....just so much to do - missions, quests, ground and space battle, build outposts and ships, steal ships and loot killed NPC's, get crew for ships....................goes on and on and EVERY planet...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198955566265\/recommended\/1716740\/","votes_up":8}]},{"appid":3357960,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"222781111","appid":3357960,"accountid":176330507,"playtime_at_review":212,"review_text":"If you like cooking games, then this is a no brainer. Easily a top cooking sim of 2026! It is a dash of Cooking Mama, with a lil quirkiness from Good Pizza, Great Pizza meets anime style Top Chef all...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198136596235\/recommended\/3357960\/","votes_up":47},{"recommendationid":"222765056","appid":3357960,"accountid":1581771047,"playtime_at_review":236,"review_text":"Game of the year! Cozy, cute and wonderful! Very nostalgic for cooking mama fans but with more heart, storytelling and a TWIST (not just a meatball twist!)!? Also I voice Ume so I am bias! ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199542036775\/recommended\/3357960\/","votes_up":16},{"recommendationid":"222789920","appid":3357960,"accountid":330161420,"playtime_at_review":82,"review_text":"I\u2019m obsessed with this game! It\u2019s so cute, fun, and cozyyy \u2728\ud83e\ude77 The art is absolutely gorgeous too!! I didn\u2019t expect it to be this good for the price. It even makes me crave bakso for some reason haha. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198290427148\/recommended\/3357960\/","votes_up":9},{"recommendationid":"222757231","appid":3357960,"accountid":151590081,"playtime_at_review":233,"review_text":"I can't rave about this game enough! Played the demo and bought it on release, without waiting for reviews. That's absolutely how good it is. No bugs on release. Polished. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198111855809\/recommended\/3357960\/","votes_up":12},{"recommendationid":"222786956","appid":3357960,"accountid":1106255866,"playtime_at_review":85,"review_text":"Gamenya sudah bagus, mungkin bisa di update varian resolusi (Low\/Med\/High) jg anti-aliansing dsb (klo bisa aja ini opsional), penvahayaan karakter agak pecah dikit trs ngeubah detail karakternya, tp...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199066521594\/recommended\/3357960\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"222800408","appid":3357960,"accountid":406165981,"playtime_at_review":179,"review_text":"Super fun cooking management game with super cute characters! It's very simple, and there's a cozy mode as well so if you prefer to just play casually and not being rushed, you can, too! ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198366431709\/recommended\/3357960\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"222769111","appid":3357960,"accountid":106817272,"playtime_at_review":608,"review_text":"Kuloniku bowel up is one of them rare entertaining cooking simulation with a great story for everyone. It cooking mama meets good pizza great pizza. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198067083000\/recommended\/3357960\/","votes_up":3}]},{"appid":1315180,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"222761463","appid":1315180,"accountid":63858237,"playtime_at_review":100,"review_text":"A challenging dungeon crawler with a magnificent horror atmosphere. T