ue,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197965693700\/recommended\/2779120\/","votes_up":5}]},{"appid":275850,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"222761241","appid":275850,"accountid":193747717,"playtime_at_review":140,"review_text":"I picked this up after watching the Artemis II mission to the Moon. Safe to say, this game is miles better than it was at launch. Amaze. Amaze. Amaze. \ud83d\ude80","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198154013445\/recommended\/275850\/","votes_up":8}]},{"appid":4249120,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"222790317","appid":4249120,"accountid":130371217,"playtime_at_review":517,"review_text":"Holds up way better then I thought it would. The atmosphere is perfect and I like the fixed camera angles, Nemesis is cool and scary and follows you around the whole game. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198090636945\/recommended\/4249120\/","votes_up":4}]}],
